4. Bibliographic Reference Data (Grand Comics Database Attribution)
========================================================================

Galactic Library incorporates bibliographic issue boundary and numbering
data in src/lib/publication-reference-data.js to support comic publication
resolution and coverage analysis (documented in
docs/architecture/publication-resolution.md).

Reference issue boundaries and numbering were verified against public
bibliographic records from the Grand Comics Database (GCD,
https://www.comics.org).

The Grand Comics Database makes its content available under the Creative
Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 4.0 International License (CC-BY-SA 4.0).

Under applicable copyright law, purely factual historical publication
data (such as issue numbers, publication dates, and issue counts)
constitutes uncopyrightable factual information. To the extent that any
selection or arrangement of this reference data constitutes protectable
database content or creative expression, it is attributed to the Grand
Comics Database under CC-BY-SA 4.0. Creative Commons CC-BY-SA 4.0 is
formally recognized by Creative Commons as one-way compatible with the
GNU General Public License version 3.

