5. Companion Extensions and Architecture
========================================================================

Galactic Library provides documented message-passing protocols for
independent companion browser extensions (such as Humble Library and
Fanatical Library).

Communication with Galactic Library across browser messaging boundaries
according to documented protocols does not, in itself, constitute a
derivative work of Galactic Library under copyright law. Independent
companion extensions are governed by their own licensing terms.
